 <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἐξόχως τίμας εν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">O.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.69</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δαιμόνων τιμᾶν γένος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">236</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">θεοὺς τιμῶντες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OC</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">277</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1071</span> </span> (lyr.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.29</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">σέβεσθαι καὶ τ. τοὺς θεούς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mem.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.3.13</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἱλασκομένοις καὶ τιμῶσιν.. Δία Πατρώϊον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1044.6</span> </span> (Halic., <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iv/iii B.C.</span>); <span class=\"gk\">τὸν φίλον τιμῶσιν ἐξ ἴσου πατρί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ant.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">644</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">516</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Med.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">660</span> </span> (lyr.), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.107</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">θεοὶ δ' ὅταν τιμῶσιν, οὐδὲν δεῖ φίλων</span> <